Keep a shared uppers as empty text.
Place "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ" into uppers.
Keep a shared lowers as empty text.
Place "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" into lowers.
Keep a shared source as empty text.
Place "Bob hit a ball, the hit BALL flew far after it was hit." into source.
Keep a shared target as empty text.
Keep a shared lowered as empty text.
Keep a shared found as 0.
Keep a shared place as 0.
Keep a shared targetword as empty text.
Keep a shared banned as an empty list of text.
Place "hit" into banned.
Keep a shared forbid as 0.
Keep a shared counts as an empty list of whole numbers.

To seek from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than 25, return.
The piece is the slice of uppers from spot to spot plus 1.
If piece matches target, set found to spot, return.
Seek from spot plus 1.

To soften from spot (a whole number).
The symbol is character spot of source.
Set lowered to the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
The capital is 0.
If symbol is between "A" and "Z", set capital to 1.
Set found to 0.
If capital is 1, set target to the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
If capital is 1, seek from 0.
If capital is 1, The small is the slice of lowers from found to found plus 1, Set lowered to small.

To forbid.
Set forbid to 0.
For every spot from 0 to the last position of banned.
If item spot of banned matches targetword, set forbid to 1.

To raise from spot (a whole number).
Set item spot of counts to item spot of counts plus 1.

To locate.
Set place to -1.
For every spot from 0 to the last position of seen.
If item spot of seen matches targetword, set place to spot.

The last is the last position of source.
The normalized is empty text.
For every spot from 0 to last.
Soften from spot.
Place lowered into normalized.

The washed is a copy of normalized.
The washedlast is the last position of washed.
The words is an empty list of text.
The current is empty text.
For every spot from 0 to washedlast.
The symbol is character spot of washed.
The letter is 0.
If symbol is between "a" and "z", set letter to 1.
If letter is 1, Place symbol into current.
If letter is 0 and the length of current is more than 0, The copy is a copy of current, Place copy into words, Set current to empty text.

If the length of current is more than 0, The tail is a copy of current, Place tail into words.
Keep a shared seen as an empty list of text.
For each word in words.
Set targetword to word.
Forbid.
If forbid is 1, skip to the next one.
Locate.
The slot is place.
If place is less than 0, The fresh is a copy of word, Place fresh into seen, Place 1 into counts.
If place is at least 0, raise from slot.

The best is 0.
The answer is empty text.
For every spot from 0 to the last position of counts.
If item spot of counts is more than best, set best to item spot of counts, set answer to item spot of seen.

Show answer.
